    "conventions": [
      "Keys are English snake_case and never change once seeded; labels and other text shown to users are Indonesian.",
      "Codes follow SIGRAK-KAT-<AREA>-NN for the main items of a file and SIGRAK-KAT-<AREA>-<LIST>-NN for its secondary lists (see README.md). Codes are stable: a retired item keeps its code, and new items take the next free number.",
      "No identifier from the legacy app is carried over. Where a decision keeps an old label for reference (D-305), it sits in legacy_label and is never shown in the UI.",
      "review_notes are Indonesian notes for Tim Validasi SIGRAK; they are not shown to teachers.",
      "Themes are local sample themes, not official ones: Panduan Kokurikuler 2025 leaves themes to each school, so a school may add its own. offered = false keeps an old theme readable but hides it from new activities.",
      "form uses the keys of docs/data/regulations/cocurricular-guide-bskap.json (forms.items): cross_disciplinary_collaborative (minimum 2 subjects), g7kaih, other_ways.",
      "dimensions use the keys of docs/data/regulations/cocurricular-guide-bskap.json (graduate_profile_dimensions.items).",
      "related_subjects use subject codes from docs/data/curriculum/subjects.json. An empty list means the subjects still have to be chosen (see review_notes).",
      "habits_7kaih, movement_form_7kaih, and output use the keys of the lookup lists in this file.",
      "Activities are starting suggestions for Buat > Kokurikuler (P5-04); the teacher edits them freely."
    ]
